<title>USA: Star Gas Partners Q1 net, shr rise.</title>
<headline>Star Gas Partners Q1 net, shr rise.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per unit data)</p>
<p>	   Three Months Ended  December 31,</p>
<p>								  1995</p>
<p>									 Pro</p>
<p>							1996  Forma (a)(b)</p>
<p> Sales					    $50,876    $34,634</p>
<p> Cost of sales				   29,027     15,905</p>
<p>     Gross profit				21,849     18,729</p>
<p> Operating expenses			    11,447     10,520</p>
<p> Depreciation and amortization		2,586	2,443</p>
<p> Net loss on sales of assets		   (70)	(113)</p>
<p>     Operating income			   7,746	5,653</p>
<p> Interest expense				 1,848	1,744</p>
<p>     Income before income taxes	     5,898	3,909</p>
<p> Income tax expense				   6	   11</p>
<p>     Net income				   5,892	3,898</p>
<p>General Partner's interest in</p>
<p>  net income					  118	   78</p>
<p>Limited Partners' interest in</p>
<p>  net income					5,774	3,820</p>
<p> Net income per Limited Partner unit	 1.10	 0.76</p>
<p>Weighted average number of Limited</p>
<p>  Partner units outstanding		   5,271	4,996</p>
<p>Supplementary Data:</p>
<p> EBITDA(c)					 10,402	8,209</p>
<p> Retail gallons sold			   34,374     30,844</p>
<p>NOTES: (a) Three months 1995 includes results of predecessor company, the Star Gas Group, from October 1, 1995 through December 20, 1995 combined with those of Star Gas Partners LP for period December 20, 1995 through December 31, 1995.  </p>
<p>(b) Pro forma Condensed Consolidated Statements of Operations for 1995 reflect adjustments as if the Partnership were formed on October 1, 1995.</p>
<p>(c) EBITDA is operating income plus depreciation, amortization, less net gain (loss) on sales of assets.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
